= A debate on the constitution

At its congress on 26 October 1924 the Popular National Union (ZLN) adopted a resolution on the “repair of the constitution”: a President who may dissolve the Sejm, a Senate equal to the Sejm, fewer deputies, a narrower immunity and a constitutional tribunal. In December 1924 the congress of PSL “Piast” also declared a change of the constitution necessary. The revision of the March Constitution is on the agenda.

From now on PPS can prepare and table its own projects with the card Constitutional Reform.

- @root: Continue.
